      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → OpenRouter → OpenRouter settings**.\n2. Describe the shot in **Brief**.\n3. Press **Run**. The video is saved under `video/openrouter`.\n\nFour paid requests per run. Video is billed per second, so check its price at openrouter.ai/models first."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
